of ",[311,781,782],{},"USelectMenu"," such as ",[311,785,786],{},"description-key"," work directly too; field names are inferred from ",[311,789,443],{},", and a wrong name is a type error.",[359,792],{"name":793},"select-menu-keys",[333,795,797],{"id":796},"search","Search",[308,799,800,801,804,805,807,808,811],{},"The menu has a built-in search input with the placeholder \"Search...\" (\"關鍵字查詢...\" in Traditional Chinese), which can be changed in ",[320,802,47],{"href":803},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items",". The search matches the ",[311,806,775],{}," field and is not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[311,809,810],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[359,813],{"name":814},"select-menu-search",[333,816,818],{"id":817},"variants","Variants",[308,820,821,822,825,826,378,829,832,833,357],{},"Uses the ",[311,823,824],{},"variant",", ",[311,827,828],{},"color",[311,830,831],{},"highlight"," of ",[311,834,782],{},[359,836],{"name":837},"select-menu-variant",[333,839,841],{"id":840},"icon","Icon",[308,843,821,844,378,846,832,849,851,852,854,855,857],{},[311,845,840],{},[311,847,848],{},"trailing-icon",[311,850,782],{},"; ",[311,853,840],{}," shows on the left, and ",[311,856,848],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[359,859],{"name":860},"select-menu-icon",[333,862,864],{"id":863},"size-and-states","Size and states",[308,866,867,868,871],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[320,869,102],{"href":870},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[359,873],{"name":874},"select-menu-states",[328,876,878],{"id":877},"examples","Examples",[333,880,882],{"id":881},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[308,884,885,886,888,889,892,893,888,895,357],{},"An empty single selection is ",[311,887,348],{},", so use ",[311,890,891],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[311,894,356],{},[311,896,897],{},"requiredArray",[359,899],{"name":900},"select-menu-validation",[333,902,904],{"id":903},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[308,906,907,908,911,912,318,915,919],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[320,909,217],{"href":910},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[311,913,914],{},"ui.wrapper",[320,916,918],{"href":917},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[359,921],{"name":922},"select-menu-truncate",[333,924,926],{"id":925},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[308,928,929,930,933,934,936,937,940],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[311,931,932],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[311,935,443],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[311,938,939],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[359,942],{"name":943},"select-menu-async",[333,945,947],{"id":946},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[308,949,950,951,953],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[311,952,443],{}," are computed from the city.",[359,955],{"name":956},"select-menu-cascade",[333,958,960],{"id":959},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[308,962,963,964,967,968,971],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[311,965,966],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[311,969,970],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[359,973],{"name":974},"select-menu-expose",[328,976,978],{"id":977},"props","Props",[980,981],"component-props",{"name":416},[308,983,984,985,988,989,825,992,825,995,825,997,825,1000,378,1003,357],{},"Se